    "description": "In the central field, the stylized representation of the caldén, exclusive species of our country and owner of a characteristic broad and rounded glass; in the upper arch, the text \"REPÚBLICA ARGENTINA\" and in the lower one, \"CALDÉN\", common name of the tree.",
