  "reverse": {
    "description": "On the back, there is a synthesis of the flower and, in small characters, the denomination in numbers continuously, and leaves of the caldén. In the upper arch, the motto \"EN UNIÓN Y LIBERTAD\", and in the lower arch, the year of minting \"2018\". The location of the denomination \"10 PESOS\" symbolizes the section where the tree is original within our country, in this case, the center.",
