  "comments": "<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">The Caldén</span><br /><br />\r\nProsopis caldenia. Family of the fabaceae or legumes. Common name: caldén.<br />\r\nIt is an endemic prosopis, that is, it only grows in Argentina, in the center of the country, especially in La Pampa where its figure is the provincial shield. It also grows in San Luis, Córdoba, Mendoza, and southwest of Buenos Aires. To see it in its natural habitat, you can visit the Lihué Calel National Park.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Caldén tree</span><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c199c3abadc8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c199c3abadc8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"133\" /></a>",
